WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
Welcome! I'm Mariam, and thank you for taking
the time to visit my website. For the past two years,

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:11.520
I've been working in the iGaming industry as a
game show host. Every day I communicate with

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.840
hundreds of players from different countries —
thinking quickly, adapting to new situations, and

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:22.800
making sure every interaction is a positive one.
As I started thinking about the next step in

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.740
my career, I also invested my time in developing
new skills by completing customer support courses,

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:34.460
including Intercom and Zendesk. I'm always
looking for opportunities to learn and grow.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:40.780
Now I'm excited to move into customer support,
customer success, operations, or player experience.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:46.560
I enjoy working with people, solving problems,
and being part of a team, and I would love to

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:52.520
continue building my career in the iGaming
industry. Feel free to explore my website to

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:59.860
learn more about my experience, skills, and
certifications. Thank you for watching — I look
forward to connecting with you.
